<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.00-1.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.00-1.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$1.00-1.25 lower. Trade moderately active. Top $54.75 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    54.25-54.75, mostly 54.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    53.75-54.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    52.75-53.75</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    51.75-52.75</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    50.75-51.75</p>
<p>Sows weak to 1.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    44.50</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    47.00-49.00, mostly 47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
